      "id": "claim_c646a0f448664a819232a7a0d93f2510",
      "statement": "StageMeta carries a reproducibility declaration — a deterministic field that may be a boolean or a string plus a nondeterminism reason — which the runner copies verbatim into the stage ledger and the artifact provenance envelope, so a stage's reproducibility claim is read from the same declaration the code registered.",
