      "id": "claim_4e0ebb7718b84fc1a059e71b5a563072",
      "statement": "Dependency ordering is a three-colour depth-first search appending nodes in post-order, where re-entering a grey node raises CyclicDependencyError naming that stage and an already-black node returns immediately so a diamond dependency appears exactly once.",
